<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5750] Format of uptime for metrics</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5750</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Metrics for local node shows uptime formatted as 00:00:00:000&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But the last colon should be changed to the dot.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Right format is 00:00:00.000&lt;/p&gt;</description>
